# Species traits, granted automatically by the species that owns them.

Dragonborn ~ Draconic Ancestry	KEY:Dragonborn ~ Draconic Ancestry	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dragonborn Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Draconic Ancestry	BONUS:VAR|POOL_Draconic_Ancestry|1	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:Your lineage stems from a dragon progenitor. Choose the kind of dragon from the Draconic Ancestors table. Your choice affects your Breath Weapon and Damage Resistance traits as well as your appearance.
Dragonborn ~ Breath Weapon	KEY:Dragonborn ~ Breath Weapon	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dragonborn Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Breath Weapon	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can replace one of your attacks with an exhalation of magical energy in either a 15-foot Cone or a 30-foot Line that is 5 feet wide (choose the shape each time). Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 plus your Constitution modifier and Proficiency Bonus). On a failed save, a creature takes 1d10 damage of the type determined by your Draconic Ancestry trait. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage. This damage increases by 1d10 when you reach character levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10). You can use this Breath Weapon a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.
Dragonborn ~ Damage Resistance	KEY:Dragonborn ~ Damage Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dragonborn Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Damage Resistance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:You have Resistance to the damage type determined by your Draconic Ancestry trait.
Dragonborn ~ Darkvision	KEY:Dragonborn ~ Darkvision	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dragonborn Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Darkvision	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Base	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.
Dragonborn ~ Draconic Flight	KEY:Dragonborn ~ Draconic Flight	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dragonborn Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Draconic Flight	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:When you reach character level 5, you can channel draconic magic to give yourself temporary flight. As a Bonus Action, you sprout spectral wings on your back that last for 10 minutes or until you retract the wings (no action required) or have the Incapacitated condition. During that time, you have a Fly Speed equal to your Speed. Your wings appear to be made of the same energy as your Breath Weapon. Once you use this trait, you can’t use it again until you finish a Long Rest.
Dwarf ~ Darkvision	KEY:Dwarf ~ Darkvision	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dwarf Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Darkvision	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|120|TYPE=Base	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:You have Darkvision with a range of 120 feet.
Dwarf ~ Dwarven Resilience	KEY:Dwarf ~ Dwarven Resilience	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dwarf Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Dwarven Resilience	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:You have Resistance to Poison damage. You also have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Poisoned condition.
Dwarf ~ Dwarven Toughness	KEY:Dwarf ~ Dwarven Toughness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dwarf Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Dwarven Toughness	BONUS:HP|CURRENTMAX|TL*1	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:Your Hit Point maximum increases by 1, and it increases by 1 again whenever you gain a level.
Dwarf ~ Stonecunning	KEY:Dwarf ~ Stonecunning	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Dwarf Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Stonecunning	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:As a Bonus Action, you gain Tremorsense with a range of 60 feet for 10 minutes. You must be on a stone surface or touching a stone surface to use this Tremorsense. The stone can be natural or worked. You can use this Bonus Action a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.
Elf ~ Darkvision	KEY:Elf ~ Darkvision	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Elf Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Darkvision	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Base	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.
Elf ~ Elven Lineage	KEY:Elf ~ Elven Lineage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Elf Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Elven Lineage	BONUS:VAR|POOL_Elven_Lineage|1	BONUS:VAR|POOL_Elven_Lineage_Spellcasting_Ability|1	DEFINE:ElvenLineageSpellDC|0	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:You are part of a lineage that grants you supernatural abilities. Choose a lineage from the Elven Lineages table. You gain the level 1 benefit of that lineage. When you reach character levels 3 and 5, you learn a higher-level spell, as shown on the table. You always have that spell prepared. You can cast it once without a spell slot, and you regain the ability to cast it in that way when you finish a Long Rest. You can also cast the spell using any spell slots you have of the appropriate level. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for the spells you cast with this trait (choose the ability when you select the lineage).
Elf ~ Fey Ancestry	KEY:Elf ~ Fey Ancestry	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Elf Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fey Ancestry	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Charmed condition.
Elf ~ Keen Senses	KEY:Elf ~ Keen Senses	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Elf Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Keen Senses	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:You have proficiency in the Insight, Perception, or Survival skill.
Elf ~ Trance	KEY:Elf ~ Trance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Elf Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Trance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:You don’t need to sleep, and magic can’t put you to sleep. You can finish a Long Rest in 4 hours if you spend those hours in a trancelike meditation, during which you retain consciousness.
Gnome ~ Darkvision	KEY:Gnome ~ Darkvision	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gnome Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Darkvision	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Base	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.
Gnome ~ Gnomish Cunning	KEY:Gnome ~ Gnomish Cunning	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gnome Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Gnomish Cunning	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:You have Advantage on Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma saving throws.
Gnome ~ Gnomish Lineage	KEY:Gnome ~ Gnomish Lineage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Gnome Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Gnomish Lineage	BONUS:VAR|POOL_Gnomish_Lineage|1	BONUS:VAR|POOL_Gnomish_Lineage_Spellcasting_Ability|1	DEFINE:GnomishLineageSpellDC|0	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:You are part of a lineage that grants you supernatural abilities. Choose one of the following options; whichever one you choose, Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for the spells you cast with this trait (choose the ability when you select the lineage):
Goliath ~ Giant Ancestry	KEY:Goliath ~ Giant Ancestry	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Goliath Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Giant Ancestry	BONUS:VAR|POOL_Giant_Ancestry|1	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:You are descended from Giants. Choose one of the following benefits—a supernatural boon from your ancestry; you can use the chosen benefit a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest:
Goliath ~ Large Form	KEY:Goliath ~ Large Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Goliath Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Large Form	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:Starting at character level 5, you can change your size to Large as a Bonus Action if you’re in a big enough space. This transformation lasts for 10 minutes or until you end it (no action required). For that duration, you have Advantage on Strength checks, and your Speed increases by 10 feet. Once you use this trait, you can’t use it again until you finish a Long Rest.
Goliath ~ Powerful Build	KEY:Goliath ~ Powerful Build	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Goliath Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Powerful Build	BONUS:LOADMULT|TYPE=SIZE|1	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:You have Advantage on any ability check you make to end the Grappled condition. You also count as one size larger when determining your carrying capacity.
Halfling ~ Brave	KEY:Halfling ~ Brave	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Halfling Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Brave	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Frightened condition.
Halfling ~ Halfling Nimbleness	KEY:Halfling ~ Halfling Nimbleness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Halfling Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Halfling Nimbleness	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:You can move through the space of any creature that is a size larger than you, but you can’t stop in the same space.
Halfling ~ Luck	KEY:Halfling ~ Luck	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Halfling Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Luck	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:When you roll a 1 on the d20 of a D20 Test, you can reroll the die, and you must use the new roll.
Halfling ~ Naturally Stealthy	KEY:Halfling ~ Naturally Stealthy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Halfling Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Naturally Stealthy	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:You can take the Hide action even when you are obscured only by a creature that is at least one size larger than you.
Human ~ Resourceful	KEY:Human ~ Resourceful	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Human Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Resourceful	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:You gain Heroic Inspiration whenever you finish a Long Rest.
Human ~ Skillful	KEY:Human ~ Skillful	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Human Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Skillful	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Skill Proficiency|1	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:You gain proficiency in one skill of your choice.
Human ~ Versatile	KEY:Human ~ Versatile	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Human Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Versatile	BONUS:VAR|POOL_Origin_Feat|1	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:You gain an Origin feat of your choice (see “Feats”). Skilled is recommended.
Orc ~ Adrenaline Rush	KEY:Orc ~ Adrenaline Rush	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Orc Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Adrenaline Rush	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:You can take the Dash action as a Bonus Action. When you do so, you gain a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to your Proficiency Bonus. You can use this trait a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Short or Long Rest.
Orc ~ Darkvision	KEY:Orc ~ Darkvision	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Orc Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Darkvision	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|120|TYPE=Base	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:You have Darkvision with a range of 120 feet.
Orc ~ Relentless Endurance	KEY:Orc ~ Relentless Endurance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Orc Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Relentless Endurance	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:When you are reduced to 0 Hit Points but not killed outright, you can drop to 1 Hit Point instead. Once you use this trait, you can’t do so again until you finish a Long Rest.
Tiefling ~ Darkvision	KEY:Tiefling ~ Darkvision	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Tiefling Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Darkvision	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|60|TYPE=Base	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.
Tiefling ~ Fiendish Legacy	KEY:Tiefling ~ Fiendish Legacy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Tiefling Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Fiendish Legacy	BONUS:VAR|POOL_Fiendish_Legacy|1	BONUS:VAR|POOL_Fiendish_Legacy_Spellcasting_Ability|1	DEFINE:FiendishLegacySpellDC|0	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:You are the recipient of a legacy that grants you supernatural abilities. Choose a legacy from the Fiendish Legacies table. You gain the level 1 benefit of the chosen legacy. When you reach character levels 3 and 5, you learn a higher-level spell, as shown on the table. You always have that spell prepared. You can cast it once without a spell slot, and you regain the ability to cast it in that way when you finish a Long Rest. You can also cast the spell using any spell slots you have of the appropriate level. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for the spells you cast with this trait (choose the ability when you select the legacy).
Tiefling ~ Otherworldly Presence	KEY:Tiefling ~ Otherworldly Presence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Tiefling Trait.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	OUTPUTNAME:Otherworldly Presence	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:You know the Thaumaturgy cantrip. When you cast it with this trait, the spell uses the same spellcasting ability you use for your Fiendish Legacy trait.
